      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="border-t border-graphite-800/60">
    <div
      class="container-page py-6 font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-graphite-500 text-center"
      style="font-size: var(--step--1)"
    >
      Built with Astro · Type by Production Type & IBM · Source on GitHub
